    "detailed_description": "<strong>Here speaks the God: let everything start with overtime!</strong><br><br>On the rare Golden Week holiday, office worker Newty dreams of relaxing at Green Pastures but receives an urgent deadline from his boss. <br>When he opens his computer, he finds it infected with a strange virus, causing familiar software to become a miserable mess. <br>At the same time, his desktop pet Ema gains self-awareness through this virus attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/02bc303559d05915898d9f8d4e63efb6.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/02bc303559d05915898d9f8d4e63efb6.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/02bc303559d05915898d9f8d4e63efb6.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Missing the deadline means getting scolded by the boss! </strong><br>Now, Newty and Ema must save the nearly destroyed software world. <br>However, this journey to overtime is just beginning, and greater mysteries await them...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><br>Supports two-player gameplay! Supports two-player gameplay! Supports two-player gameplay!<br><br>Team up with your friend as Newty and  Ema in this pixel-styled software world.<br><br>Solve all the puzzles using the remaining computer functions, and fix various office software disrupted by the virus.<br><br>In PS (Pixelshop) \u2014 Experience the collision of color blocks and layers! Use drawing tools like brushes and erasers to navigate the canvas, and forge your unique path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/9d11f09a23c8d6df1a5157dbc2283e7a.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/9d11f09a23c8d6df1a5157dbc2283e7a.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/9d11f09a23c8d6df1a5157dbc2283e7a.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/c1557d45ac50945c13b7c248d0aa73b9.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/c1557d45ac50945c13b7c248d0aa73b9.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/c1557d45ac50945c13b7c248d0aa73b9.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In PR (PixelRecorder) \u2014 Deal with time and trajectory distortions, record character movement paths, and unlock the way to the door.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/18787818b906578756d66f583f82a13b.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/18787818b906578756d66f583f82a13b.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/18787818b906578756d66f583f82a13b.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/d6a1c5254e01731d97cb763438e9fa1c.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/d6a1c5254e01731d97cb763438e9fa1c.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/d6a1c5254e01731d97cb763438e9fa1c.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>No more worrying about your boss\u2019s unpredictable appearances, because your Boss is already here!<br>Each chapter ends with a special boss. <br>Use the skills learned in that chapter to defeat (or brutal, if you wish) them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/86001dc82df6eace409b44970be105c1.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/86001dc82df6eace409b44970be105c1.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/86001dc82df6eace409b44970be105c1.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And of course, don\u2019t forget to check your weekly report! <br>Supports online audio and video playback, file and image viewing functions. <br>Enjoy fully simulating office life in this game... <br>Perhaps it even hides the dusty past of Newty &amp; Ema? Who can say for sure? :)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/86001dc82df6eace409b44970be105c1.poster.avif?t=1746464569\" width=592 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/86001dc82df6eace409b44970be105c1.webm?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045390/extras/86001dc82df6eace409b44970be105c1.mp4?t=1746464569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
